language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ general_store: an Essence' model from DCP Rosetta.
$
$ The owner of a general store, who is something of a puzzlist, has put up this sign: C H E S S +
$ C A S H + B O W W O W + C H O P S + A L S O P S + P A L E A L E + C O O L + B A S S + H O P S +
$ A L E S + H O E S + A P P L E S + C O W S + C H E E S E + C H S O A P + S H E E P = A L L W O O
$ L. Each different letter stands for a different digit. Change all the letters to the correct
$ digits. Leading zeros are allowed: a word may start with the digit 0.
$
$   https://dcp-bench.github.io/DCP-Rosetta/problems/general_store.html
$ Save this model as model.eprime and run it with Savile Row 1.11 (it needs Java); the solution is
$ written to `model.eprime.solution`:
$   savilerow model.eprime -run-solver

$ the letters, each standing for one digit (the value of the letter in the sum)
find A : int(0..9)
find B : int(0..9)
find C : int(0..9)
find E : int(0..9)
find H : int(0..9)
find L : int(0..9)
find O : int(0..9)
find P : int(0..9)
find S : int(0..9)
find W : int(0..9)

such that
$ each different letter stands for a different digit
allDiff([A, B, C, E, H, L, O, P, S, W]),
$ the sixteen words add up to ALL WOOL
(10000 * C + 1000 * H + 100 * E + 10 * S + S) + (1000 * C + 100 * A + 10 * S + H) + (100000 * B + 10000 * O + 1000 * W + 100 * W + 10 * O + W) + (10000 * C + 1000 * H + 100 * O + 10 * P + S) + (100000 * A + 10000 * L + 1000 * S + 100 * O + 10 * P + S) + (1000000 * P + 100000 * A + 10000 * L + 1000 * E + 100 * A + 10 * L + E) + (1000 * C + 100 * O + 10 * O + L) + (1000 * B + 100 * A + 10 * S + S) + (1000 * H + 100 * O + 10 * P + S) + (1000 * A + 100 * L + 10 * E + S) + (1000 * H + 100 * O + 10 * E + S) + (100000 * A + 10000 * P + 1000 * P + 100 * L + 10 * E + S) + (1000 * C + 100 * O + 10 * W + S) + (100000 * C + 10000 * H + 1000 * E + 100 * E + 10 * S + E) + (100000 * C + 10000 * H + 1000 * S + 100 * O + 10 * A + P) + (10000 * S + 1000 * H + 100 * E + 10 * E + P) = (1000000 * A + 100000 * L + 10000 * L + 1000 * W + 100 * O + 10 * O + L)
